(7467077, 1184840, 94815, '<td valign="top">Picasso said that in his abstract paintings, he always included a realistic "key" to draw the viewer in with something recognizable (or something like that). Here the centered window does the trick and the rest is a symphony of abstraction to revel in. The composition is also well integrated with the frame (so few photos are) which is important to sensitive eyes who see the edges as part of the image. bump</td>', 'Picasso said that in his abstract paintings, he always included a realistic "key" to draw the viewer in with something recognizable (or something like that). Here the centered window does the trick and the rest is a symphony of abstraction to revel in. The composition is also well integrated with the frame (so few photos are) which is important to sensitive eyes who see the edges as part of the image. bump', '2016-08-04 22:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7467078, 1184858, 94815, '<td valign="top">I''m torn by this - a masterful shot of the bird but the exposure (or processing) seems way to light. So I thought: maybe its trying to be expressionistic as if the screech of the bird bleached out the scene. OK. I like that. bump</td>', 'I''m torn by this - a masterful shot of the bird but the exposure (or processing) seems way to light. So I thought: maybe its trying to be expressionistic as if the screech of the bird bleached out the scene. OK. I like that. bump', '2016-08-04 22:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7467079, 1185056, 94815, '<td valign="top">Yes indeed and this one works well as a semiabstract montage mixing natural and industrial elements. Good composition too with action throughout the frame and interacting with it. bump</td>', 'Yes indeed and this one works well as a semiabstract montage mixing natural and industrial elements. Good composition too with action throughout the frame and interacting with it. bump', '2016-08-04 23:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
